---
// src/components/WhyChooseUs.astro - Technical Supplier Value Propositions
---

<section class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 relative overflow-hidden transition-colors border-t border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800/70 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Authority Copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5 sm:space-y-6 text-left">
        <!-- Eyebrow Pill with Exact Scroll Margin -->
        <div id="about" class="scroll-mt-21 sm:scroll-mt-24 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>About Us • Gulf Pioneer Star Muscat</span>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
          Why Installers, Contractors & Villa Owners <br />
          <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-sky-600 via-cyan-500 to-blue-600 dark:from-cyan-400 dark:via-sky-300 dark:to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            Choose GPS Muscat.
          </span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          We bridge the gap between world-class European automation manufacturers and local projects in Oman. We maintain local stock in our Muscat warehouses, provide technical wiring diagrams, and ensure prompt replacement parts delivery across Seeb, Al Khuwair, Qurum, Madinat Al Sultan Qaboos, Al Khoudh, and Ghala.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            title="Visit GPS Muscat Branches in Al Khoudh or Ghala"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 dark:bg-white dark:hover:bg-slate-100 text-white dark:text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95"
          >
            <span>Visit Al Khoudh or Ghala Branch</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: 4 Value Pillar Cards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
        
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 space-y-2.5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            📦
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Muscat Ready Stock</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            No 4-to-6 week shipping delays. Motors, steel racks, barrier arms, and control boards are stocked locally for same-day dispatch.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 space-y-2.5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            🏢
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Two Physical Branches</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Convenient trade counters in Al Khoudh and Ghala. Walk in for counter consultations, replacement remotes, or equipment pickups.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 space-y-2.5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            ☀️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Climate-Tested Motors</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Heavy-duty oil-bath gearboxes and UV-stabilized enclosures rated for Oman's summer heat exceeding 55°C to 65°C.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 space-y-2.5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            ⚙️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Technical Sizing Guidance</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            We help calculate gate weights, wind loads, cable gauges, and loop sensor layouts before you install.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
